# BML Installation Guide

BML is a C++17 matrix library built with CMake. It supports both static and shared libraries and is intended to build with GCC, Clang and MSVC.

## Contents

- [Requirements](#requirements)
- [Repository Structure](#repository-structure)
- [Configuring BML](#configuring-bml)
- [Building BML](#building-bml)
- [Running the Tests](#running-the-tests)
